<h2 align="center">Trade Skills Item List </h2>

<p> The following items are used for Trade Skills and may be of use to our guildmembers
who are interested in crafting.

<ol>
<li>DYE Components: permafrost crystals, evergreen leaves, sarcoscyha fungus,
russet oxide, iron oxide, jack o'lantern fungus, charcoal. </li>
<br>
<li>Smithing tempers: blood (elf, griffene, sarnak, ice goblin, froglok, iksar, dwarf, human),
essences (shadows, sunshine, winter, moonlight), neriak nectar, lava rocks, rain water, 
bloodwater, morning dew, swirling mists, sea foam, drops of mercury.</li>
<br>
<li>Cultural Armor: misty acorns, brute hides, plains pebbles, morning dew, oak bark, 
sabertooth tiger hides. </li>
<br>
<li>Baking: eggs (almost all kinds), brownie parts.</li>
<br>
<li>Pottery: Sand of Ro.</li>

</p>
Trade Skill Comments, Suggestions, Additions, send to:
<a href="mailto:gorte.mcginty@verizon.net">gorte.mcginty@verizon.net</a> 


